    <statement><p>Find the equation of the line tangent to the graph of <m>y=4 \ln(x)</m>
at <m>x=3</m>.</p>
<p>Tangent Line: <m>y =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>1.33333\mathopen{}\left(x-3\right)+4\ln\mathopen{}\left(3\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
